    /*
     * MCP3008 SPI protocol (3 bytes):
     *   Byte 0: 0x01  (start bit)
     *   Byte 1: 0x80 | (channel << 4)  (single-ended + channel select)
     *   Byte 2: 0x00  (don't care, clocks out low 2 bits)
     *
     * Response:
     *   rx[1] bits 1:0  -> MSB of 10-bit result
     *   rx[2]          -> LSB of 10-bit result
